# Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer: "Flying, vigilance" and "At the beginning of your end step, if you haven't cast a spell from
# your hand this turn, draw a card." (CR 603.4). Jem is cast on turn 1 (a spell from hand, so no draw at that end step) and
# Bot2's turn 2 end step is not Bot1's. On turn 3 Bot1 plays a land (not a spell) and attacks with Jem, who stays untapped
# (vigilance) and deals 3 in the air (17): at Bot1's end step the trigger draws one card, 2 in hand -> 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer.Cast
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.End]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
